{"product_id":"an-offer-you-cant-refuse-paperback-mansell-jill","title":"An Offer You Can't Refuse [Paperback] Mansell, Jill","description":"\u003cp\u003eA copy that has been read, but is in excellent condition. Pages are intact and not marred by notes or highlighting. The spine remains undamaged.A sweet, funny and romantic novel from the Sunday Times\" No. 1 bestseller.Lola has no intention of accepting when her boyfriend Dougie's snobbish mother offers her 10,000 to break up with him. Then she discovers a secret that makes her think again. Dougie would probably have broken up with her in the long run, and this way she can help one of the people she loves most in the world.Ten years later, though, when Lola meets Dougie again, her feelings for him are as strong as ever. But she broke Dougie's heart and he's about to discover that she was paid to do it. She can never tell him the truth, so can she get him back? Well, Lola's very attractive and very persuasive. But even she's got her work cut out this time.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 147 x 199\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Jill Mansell\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780755328161\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 416\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45195441766553,"sku":"12RA9780755328161","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/81tFgOPgFPL.jpg?v=1763390161","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/an-offer-you-cant-refuse-paperback-mansell-jill","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}